 R←Test_35(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;myEventLog;msg;buffer
⍝ `API.ReportErrorToWindowsLog` writes to the Windows Event Log
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 :If 'Win'≢APLTreeUtils2.GetOperatingSystem ⍬
     R←T._WindowsOnly
     :Return
 :EndIf

 R←T._Failed

⍝ Preconditions...
 myEventLog←⎕NEW WindowsEventLog(,⊂'Foo')
 myEventLog.WriteInfo'"Foo" created'
 ⎕EX'myEventLog'
 msg←'HandleError Test_35 ',⍕⎕TS

 {}##.HandleError.API.ReportErrorToWindowsLog'Foo'msg

 myEventLog←⎕NEW WindowsEventLog(,⊂'Foo')
 buffer←myEventLog.ReadThese{⎕IO←0 ⋄ (10>⍵):⍳⍵ ⋄ ⍵+-⍳10}myEventLog.NumberOfLogEntries
 →T.PassesIf 1=+/∨/¨msg∘⍷¨buffer

 R←T._OK
